description "Jar Jar Binks

Mesa, uh, clumsy...

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- Slicks on hit
-- 25% faster rate of fire
- Grand Gungan Ticklers (Dual Saber)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 1
-- Trips/slicks on hit
-- 300% more knockback
-- 100/25% shorter
-- 100% more special damage
-- 400% thicker
- Ptooie (DC Carb 1)
-- Heals allies on hit
-- 5000% slower reload
- Salvaged E-5 Blaster Rifle (T-21 1)
-- 50% faster reload
-- 50% less damage
- Boomas (4) (Pulse Grenades)
-- 100% more damage
-- Primary fire only

^5Powers:
- Jarlord's Jump (1)

^8Attributes:
- Bunny Hop (2)
- Slow Faller
- Stamina (3)
-- Extra Regen: 5/.001s to 35
- Dexterity (3)
- Blast Armor
- Healing (2)
- Underwater Breathing
- Getup (3)
- 190% slower skill cooldown
- 50% slower hacking
- 50% more knockback given
- 50% more knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Gungan Jive (Toxic Taunt)
- Flipkick (2) ^3[Contact Jump]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Spin Attack (Barge) ^3[Melee CS2]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS3]
- Dash/Dash Jump (1) ^3[CS4]"